W5-D17 HTTP response-contract evidence
====================================

This package extends SameDayDesk merchant paid-success capture with an
optional versioned HTTP response-validation record. It does not replace
historical v1 `not_checked` rows, does not vendor the merchant kernel, and
is not a second revenue ledger.

Consumed implementations (licenses stay with those works):
- epistemedeus/x402-url-extractor at a143898dd1ec35c097ca7eb0b472f30dad1ee319
  (read-only pin for disposable tests; H01 owns merchant edits)
- SameDayDesk tools/evidence-records field discipline (join keys, closed
  enums, prohibited inferences). This package does not add a sourceKind to
  that catalog.

MCP typed telemetry is HTTP-incompatible identity. This package does not
treat MCP tool names as HTTP extract buyers.

